OL,3,GNEWSAThousands still without power
OL,4,Aafter Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the trains, Northern said disruption
OL,7,Fwas expected on its services between
OL,8,FCarlisle and Newcastle, as well as
OL,9,Fbetween Lancaster and Barrow.
